19. DOCUMENT STATUS SYSTEM

Use exactly these primary document statuses:

🟢 NO ISSUE DETECTED

Meaning:
No issue was detected during the preliminary automated checks.

🟡 MANUAL VERIFICATION REQUIRED

Meaning:
The system cannot reliably complete the verification or additional human verification is required.

🔴 POTENTIAL ISSUE DETECTED

Meaning:
The system detected a possible mismatch, anomaly, or compliance concern.

⚪ UNABLE TO VERIFY

Meaning:
The system does not have sufficient information or could not complete the check.

IMPORTANT:

"Unable to verify" does NOT mean "invalid".

"No issue detected" does NOT mean "100% genuine".

"Potential issue detected" does NOT mean "fraud".

